**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyd

# Jupyter Notebook checkpoints
**/.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Vector Stores & Local Databases
**/chroma_db/
**/faiss_index/

# IDE & Editor files
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# OS files
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
